  "details_description": "Cumilla Polytechnic Institute High Tech Club (CPI HTC) in collaboration with Programming Hero is organizing a grand Career Summit at our campus.\n\nThis summit brings together industry experts, successful tech professionals, and aspiring students under one roof. It's a unique opportunity to gain insights into the tech industry, learn about career paths, and network with like-minded individuals.\n\nWhether you're a student exploring career options or someone looking to advance in the tech field, this summit offers valuable sessions, workshops, and networking opportunities that can shape your future.",
